    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Nightmare. Shape the Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard the <strong>Sea of Dreams</strong>\u2014a haunted vessel adrift in a nightmare realm. In this intense <strong>action rogue-lite</strong>, you'll battle through endless waves of twisted enemies in a fight for survival. Will you make it out alive\u2014or become just another lost soul?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Slay. Adapt. Overcome.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>9 unique survivors</strong>, each with distinct abilities. Blast through hundreds of nightmarish foes with an arsenal of <strong>17 powerful weapons</strong>\u2014from flamethrowers to throwing tantos. Gain <strong>XP</strong>, unlock devastating <strong>perks</strong>, and build unstoppable combos as the chaos ramps up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 A Rogue-lite with Relentless Momentum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a chance to grow stronger. Earn <strong>permanent upgrades</strong>, climb <strong>20 ranks</strong>, and craft the perfect build with <strong>15+ game-changing perks</strong>. Fail or succeed\u2014progression is always yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf 17 Unique Weapons</strong> \u2013 Flamethrowers, rocket launchers, sniper rifles, and more. Build your perfect loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2640\ufe0f 9 Playable Characters</strong> \u2013 Each with their own traits. Find your favorite survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f 20 Ranks to Climb</strong> \u2013 Unlock rewards, perks, and upgrades with every level gained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 15+ Perks</strong> \u2013 Mix and match to create devastating builds: offensive, defensive, and everything in between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2620\ufe0f 16+ Enemy Types</strong> \u2013 Face horrors from The Other World with deadly attack patterns and evolving behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0a 10 Distinct Levels</strong> \u2013 Battle through terrifying environments aboard the Sea of Dreams.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Custom Game Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the campaign to unlock a fully tweakable experience. Adjust everything\u2014from difficulty to weapon count, enemy scaling, and more. Create your own challenge or total chaos. <strong>Your nightmare, your rules.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2696\ufe0f Difficulty Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the story or the pain, choose from multiple difficulty levels\u2014<strong>Easy to Legendary</strong>. Higher risk, greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare begins. Will you survive the Sea of Dreams?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Nightmare. Shape the Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard the <strong>Sea of Dreams</strong>\u2014a haunted vessel adrift in a nightmare realm. In this intense <strong>action rogue-lite</strong>, you'll battle through endless waves of twisted enemies in a fight for survival. Will you make it out alive\u2014or become just another lost soul?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Slay. Adapt. Overcome.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>9 unique survivors</strong>, each with distinct abilities. Blast through hundreds of nightmarish foes with an arsenal of <strong>17 powerful weapons</strong>\u2014from flamethrowers to throwing tantos. Gain <strong>XP</strong>, unlock devastating <strong>perks</strong>, and build unstoppable combos as the chaos ramps up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 A Rogue-lite with Relentless Momentum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a chance to grow stronger. Earn <strong>permanent upgrades</strong>, climb <strong>20 ranks</strong>, and craft the perfect build with <strong>15+ game-changing perks</strong>. Fail or succeed\u2014progression is always yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf 17 Unique Weapons</strong> \u2013 Flamethrowers, rocket launchers, sniper rifles, and more. Build your perfect loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2640\ufe0f 9 Playable Characters</strong> \u2013 Each with their own traits. Find your favorite survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f 20 Ranks to Climb</strong> \u2013 Unlock rewards, perks, and upgrades with every level gained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 15+ Perks</strong> \u2013 Mix and match to create devastating builds: offensive, defensive, and everything in between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2620\ufe0f 16+ Enemy Types</strong> \u2013 Face horrors from The Other World with deadly attack patterns and evolving behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0a 10 Distinct Levels</strong> \u2013 Battle through terrifying environments aboard the Sea of Dreams.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Custom Game Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the campaign to unlock a fully tweakable experience. Adjust everything\u2014from difficulty to weapon count, enemy scaling, and more. Create your own challenge or total chaos. <strong>Your nightmare, your rules.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2696\ufe0f Difficulty Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the story or the pain, choose from multiple difficulty levels\u2014<strong>Easy to Legendary</strong>. Higher risk, greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare begins. Will you survive the Sea of Dreams?</p>",
